      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### External sites\n\n* Code coverage & benchmarks: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36607\n* Ralph review <img src=https://review.fish.foo/assets/bitcoin/bitcoin/36607.png alt=\"Ralph review status\"> https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36607#author-ralph\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#36628](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36628) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36628.svg\"></sub> (net: reimplement private broadcast as jobs isolated from the node by instagibbs)\n* [#36608](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36608) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36608.svg\"></sub> (Reimplement private broadcast as node state-less jobs + package relay support by instagibbs)\n* [#36597](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36597) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36597.svg\"></sub> (wallet: return broadcast errors from CommitTransaction by pseudoramdom)\n* [#36566](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36566) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36566.svg\"></sub> (private broadcast: wait synchronously for mempool acceptance by andrewtoth)\n* [#36477](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36477) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36477.svg\"></sub> (private broadcast: show finished transactions in getprivatebroadcastinfo by vasild)\n* [#36429](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36429) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36429.svg\"></sub> ([RFC] Delayed transaction broadcast, minimal by optout21)\n* [#34824](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34824) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/34824.svg\"></sub> (net: encapsulate TxRelay state and replace recursive mutexes by w0xlt)\n\nIf you consider this pull request important, please also help to review the conflicting pull requests. Ideally, start with the one that should be merged first.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->\n### LLM Linter (✨ experimental)\n\n\n\nPossible typos and grammar issues:\n\n- `test/functional/p2p_private_broadcast_then_public.py`: `privateproadcast-aware` → `private-broadcast-aware` [misspelling]\n\n\n\n<sup>2026-10-28 05:38:27</sup>\n",
